      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Pixel Word Chain Game</title>\n  <style>\n    [hidden] {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    :root {\n      --bg-color: #0f172a;\n      --card-bg: #1e293b;\n      --primary: #38bdf8;\n      --primary-hover: #0ea5e9;\n      --primary-active: #0284c7;\n      --text-main: #f8fafc;\n      --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n      --error-bg: #451a1a;\n      --error-text: #f87171;\n      --badge-bg: #334155;\n      --border-color: #475569;\n      --focus-ring: #38bdf8;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background-color: var(--bg-color);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .game-card {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 480px;\n      background-color: var(--card-bg);\n      border: 2px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 24px;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .subtitle {\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n\n    .stats-panel {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      background: var(--badge-bg);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .counter-value {\n      font-size: 1.25rem;\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    .current-word-display {\n      text-align: center;\n      background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);\n      border: 1px dashed var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .current-label {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .current-word {\n      font-size: 1.75rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n\n    .next-hint {\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    .input-form {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .label-text {\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n\n    .input-group {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    input[type=\"text\"] {\n      flex: 1;\n      min-width: 0;\n      padding: 10px 14px;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      background-color: var(--bg-color);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;\n    }\n\n    input[type=\"text\"]:focus {\n      border-color: var(--focus-ring);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);\n    }\n\n    button {\n      padding: 10px 18px;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      background-color: var(--primary);\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.05s ease;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    button:hover {\n      background-color: var(--primary-hover);\n    }\n\n    button:active {\n      background-color: var(--primary-active);\n      transform: translateY(1px);\n    }\n\n    button:focus-visible {\n      outline: 2px solid var(--focus-ring);\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .message {\n      padding: 10px 14px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      background-color: var(--error-bg);\n      color: var(--error-text);\n      border: 1px solid var(--error-text);\n    }\n\n    .history-panel {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      padding-top: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .history-title {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .history-list {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      gap: 8px;\n      max-height: 120px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding-right: 4px;\n      list-style: none;\n    }\n\n    .history-item {\n      background-color: var(--badge-bg);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 400px) {\n      .input-group {\n        flex-direction: column;\n      }\n      button {\n        width: 100%;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"game-card\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Pixel Word Chain</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Type a word starting with the previous word's last letter</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"stats-panel\" aria-label=\"Game stats\">\n      <span>Chain Length</span>\n      <span id=\"counter\" class=\"counter-value\" aria-live=\"polite\">1</span>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"current-word-display\" aria-label=\"Current word\">\n      <div class=\"current-label\">Current Word</div>\n      <div id=\"current-word\" class=\"current-word\">pixel</div>\n      <div id=\"next-hint\" class=\"next-hint\">Next word must start with &quot;l&quot;</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <form id=\"chain-form\" class=\"input-form\" novalidate>\n      <label for=\"word-input\" class=\"label-text\">Enter next word:</label>\n      <div class=\"input-group\">\n        <input \n          type=\"text\" \n          id=\"word-input\" \n          name=\"wordInput\" \n          autocomplete=\"off\" \n          autocapitalize=\"none\" \n          spellcheck=\"false\" \n          required \n          aria-describedby=\"message-area\"\n        />\n        <button type=\"submit\" id=\"submit-btn\">Submit</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n\n    <div id=\"message-area\" class=\"message\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n\n    <section class=\"history-panel\" aria-label=\"Word chain history\">\n      <div class=\"history-title\">Used Words</div>\n      <ul id=\"history-list\" class=\"history-list\">\n        <li class=\"history-item\">pixel</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n      const initialWord = 'pixel';\n      const usedWords = new Set([initialWord.toLowerCase()]);\n      let currentWord = initialWord;\n      let chainLength = 1;\n\n      const form = document.getElementById('chain-form');\n      const wordInput = document.getElementById('word-input');\n      const counterDisplay = document.getElementById('counter');\n      const currentWordDisplay = document.getElementById('current-word');\n      const nextHintDisplay = document.getElementById('next-hint');\n      const messageArea = document.getElementById('message-area');\n      const historyList = document.getElementById('history-list');\n\n      function showMessage(text) {\n        messageArea.textContent = text;\n        messageArea.hidden = false;\n      }\n\n      function clearMessage() {\n        messageArea.textContent = '';\n        messageArea.hidden = true;\n      }\n\n      function updateNextHint(word) {\n        const requiredLetter = word.slice(-1).toLowerCase();\n        nextHintDisplay.textContent = 'Next word must start with \"' + requiredLetter + '\"';\n      }\n\n      form.addEventListener('submit', function (event) {\n        event.preventDefault();\n        clearMessage();\n\n        const rawInput = wordInput.value;\n        const word = rawInput.trim().toLowerCase();\n\n        if (!word) {\n          showMessage('Please enter a word.');\n          wordInput.focus();\n          return;\n        }\n\n        if (!/^[a-zA-Z]+$/.test(word)) {\n          showMessage('Word must contain only letters.');\n          wordInput.focus();\n          return;\n        }\n\n        const requiredLetter = currentWord.slice(-1).toLowerCase();\n        if (word.charAt(0) !== requiredLetter) {\n          showMessage('Word must start with \"' + requiredLetter + '\".');\n          wordInput.focus();\n          return;\n        }\n\n        if (usedWords.has(word)) {\n          showMessage('Already used');\n          wordInput.focus();\n          return;\n        }\n\n        // Valid word submission\n        usedWords.add(word);\n        currentWord = word;\n        chainLength += 1;\n\n        counterDisplay.textContent = chainLength;\n        currentWordDisplay.textContent = word;\n        updateNextHint(word);\n\n        const historyItem = document.createElement('li');\n        historyItem.className = 'history-item';\n        historyItem.textContent = word;\n        historyList.appendChild(historyItem);\n\n        wordInput.value = '';\n        wordInput.focus();\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main single-page application structure, pixel-themed CSS styles, and word chain game logic."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Word Chain Game\n\nA responsive, offline browser game where players build a continuous chain of words starting from **\"pixel\"**.\n\n## Rules\n1. The game starts with the word **\"pixel\"** and a chain length of **1**.\n2. Each new word must start with the last letter of the preceding word.\n3. Repeated words are rejected with **\"Already used\"**.\n4. Each valid entry increments the chain length counter and updates the history.\n\n## Constraints & Architecture\n- **Zero External Dependencies**: Pure HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n- **Self-Contained**: Runs directly in any modern browser without network requests or server.\n- **Accessible & Responsive**: Keyboard navigable with explicit labels and styled for screens from 360px upward.\n- **Defensive Styling**: Includes `[hidden] { display: none !important; }` to maintain element toggling integrity.\n\n## Getting Started\nOpen `index.html` in any web browser.",
      "description": "Project documentation including gameplay rules, architectural overview, and constraints."
    }
  ]
}